<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Anthony Tumbaco - Portafolio Periodístico</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
--bg-color: #f7f4ed;
--text-main: #1a1a1a;
--accent-red: #c0392b;
--muted-text: #706f6c;
--border-line: #dcd8ce;
}

body {
background-color: var(--bg-color);
color: var(--text-main);
font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
margin: 0;
padding: 40px 20px;
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
}

.container {
max-width: 650px;
width: 100%;
text-align: center;
}

.tagline {
font-size: 0.85rem;
letter-spacing: 3px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(--muted-text);
margin-bottom: 25px;
}

h1.author-title {
font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
font-size: 3.2rem;
line-height: 0.95;
font-weight: 700;
margin: 0 0 10px 0;
}

h1.author-title span {
display: block;
font-style: italic;
color: var(--accent-red);
font-weight: 400;
}

.divider {
border: none;
border-top: 1px solid var(--border-line);
margin: 25px 0;
}

.sub-categories {
font-size: 0.85rem;
letter-spacing: 2px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(--muted-text);
margin: 15px 0;
}

.contact-info {
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
gap: 20px;
font-size: 0.9rem;
margin-top: 25px;
flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.contact-info a {
color: var(--accent-red);
text-decoration: none;
}

.quote-section {
font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
font-style: italic;
font-size: 1.4rem;
color: #4a4a4a;
line-height: 1.5;
margin: 45px 0;
padding: 0 10px;
}

.section-header {
font-size: 0.8rem;
letter-spacing: 3px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(--muted-text);
margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.work-card {
background-color: #121212;
color: #ffffff;
border-radius: 4px;
padding: 30px 20px;
text-align: left;
margin-top: 20px;
}

.work-card .badge {
font-size: 0.75rem;
letter-spacing: 2px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: #e0a96d;
margin-bottom: 10px;
display: block;
}

.work-card h3 {
font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
font-size: 1.5rem;
margin: 0 0 10px 0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
<div class="tagline">Portafolio Periodístico</div>

<h1 class="author-title">
Anthony
<span>Tumbaco</span>
</h1>

<hr class="divider">

<div class="sub-categories">
Periodismo · Reportaje · Entrevista · Análisis Cultural
</div>

<hr class="divider">

<div class="contact-info">
<span>📍 Madrid</span>
<a href="mailto:atumbacovi2307@gmail.com">atumbacovi2307@gmail.com</a>
</div>

<div class="contact-info">
<a href="https://instagram.com/clicinformativo" target="_blank">@clicinformativo</a>
<span>Universidad Carlos III de Madrid</span>
</div>

<div class="quote-section">
Cuatro piezas. Cuatro historias que no estaban en ningún sitio antes de que fui a buscarlas.
</div>

<div class="section-header">Trabajos</div>

<div class="work-card">
<span class="badge">★ Reportaje Social Destacado</span>
<h3>El comienzo verdadero de una historia</h3>
</div>
</div>

